#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GTK3"
msgstr "Instalação do GTK3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GTK3</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>GTK3</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D man=true         \\\n"
"      -D broadway_backend=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D man=true         \\\n"
"      -D broadway_backend=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results you need a graphical session, then issue <command>dbus-"
"run-session ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados você precisa de uma sessão gráfica e, em seguida, "
"emitir <command>dbus-run-session ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Two tests, <filename>gtk:textbuffer</filename> and <filename>treeview-fixed-"
"height.ui</filename>, are known to fail due to small output differences "
"compared to what the test suite expects."
msgstr ""
"Dois testes, <filename>gtk:textbuffer</filename> e <filename>treeview-fixed-"
"height.ui</filename>, são conhecidos por falharem devido a pequenas "
"diferenças da saída gerada comparada à que a suíte de teste espera."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:158
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed the package on to your system using a "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote> method, an important file was not installed and must "
"be copied and/or generated. Generate it using the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o pacote em teu sistema usando o método "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote>, [então] um arquivo importante não foi instalado e "
"precisa ser copiado e (ou) gerado. Gere-o usando o seguinte comando como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:168
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D broadway_backend=true</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"HTML5 GTK backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D broadway_backend=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"estrutura HTML5 de retaguarda do GTK."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D man=true</parameter>: This switch allows generating manual "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D man=true</parameter>: Essa chave permite gerar páginas de "
"manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D gtk_doc=true</option>: This switch enables building "
"documentation. It requires <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D gtk_doc=true</option>: Essa chave habilita construir "
"documentação. Ela exige <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D tracker3=true</option>: This switch enables the search function "
"based on TinySPARQL in the GTK3 file chooser dialog.  It requires <xref "
"linkend=\"tinysparql\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D tracker3=true</option>: Essa chave habilita a função de pesquisa "
"baseada no TinySPARQL na caixa de diálogo do seletor de arquivos do GTK3. "
"Ela exige <xref linkend=\"tinysparql\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=true</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to enable "
"support for cloud providers in a file chooser window."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=true</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar habilitar"
" suporte para provedores de nuvem em uma janela de seletor de arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GTK3"
msgstr "Configurando GTK3"

